// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Dean_MacArthur 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Dean MacArthur 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3832856178" "Dean MacArthur"
// LocationString :
// ProfessionString :
"P1353445626" "Informant"
// DescriptionString :
"P568748725" "Dean MacArthur is a man who doesn't exactly look like he belongs in the Rogue Isles.<br><br>Speaking with him for more than a few minutes quickly reveals why he is here - to hobnob with 'supervillains' and feel important by giving them prime information that he retains.<br><br>Despite how irritating Dean may be, he has a talent for setting things up for villains to knock them down, and has no moral problems with whatever people do with his information."
// HelloString :
"P757006002" "Hey! What's up {HeroName}?"
// HelloString :
"P1238081394" "Hey {Hero.gender=male bro|beautiful}, let's make something wild happen in this place."
// HelloString :
"P1756655605" "You up for something crazy?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P846200508" "Hey, so, you know, you do what you gotta do. And when the planets align, when the stars in the sky call out for it, you and me, we'll do some business together."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3328479542" "Our time together was beautiful {HeroName}, like a rosebud blossoming, then being torn apart. You need me for anything though, you just call, you hear?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P5647061" "Whoah whoah whoah.<br><br>I'm a guy who likes getting things done, right? But when you have TOO many things to do, things can get ugly.<br><br>When your schedule is all free like, let me know."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2009302623" "Hey! What's up Diamond Dazzler Destroy? Eh? You're not the triple D?<br><br>Maybe Eruptor the Volcanic Lizard? ...no you don't look like that.<br><br>So hey, I'm drawing a blank on who you are, but you look like you're going places.<br><br>You should totally hit me up when you're at that golden Security Level, I think it's 20. Yeah, I mean I <i>know</i> when someone is at 20."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4075528258" "What's up {Hero.gender=male bro|babe}! Look, me, I'm not a guy who splits hairs, but I gotta in this situation. What I wanna do is way too small time for you, I'm even kinda nervous just <i>thinking</i> about asking you to do this stuff. You got bigger fish to fry {Hero.gender=male amigo|beautiful}!"
// IntroString :
"P2049933865" "Introduction"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2066226271" "Intro accept"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2826310298" "Intro send off"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2809179163" "Remember that guy Leonard? I totally got the 411 if you're looking to do some business with him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P2981015599" "Hey there {Hero.gender=male man|beautiful}, my name's Dean MacArthur, {Hero.gender=male how's it going?|but you can call me D-Mac, babe.} Glad you decided to stop on by my little bit of home here.<br><br>You're probably wondering right now, {Hero.gender=male who is this guy and what can he do for me?|who is this amazing man standing before me?}<br><br>Well, I'll tell you! I'm a guy who can get you information on what  YOU want.<br><br>I'm not selfish at all, see? You want something, we figure out how to get that. Or I give you a heads up on what might cause you some problems, you know?<br><br>{Hero.gender=male When you're workin' with the Dean-man, adventure comes at you like a raging river!|I don't know who would give a pretty flower like YOU problems though.}<br><br>So, what do you say? "
// Answer Text :
"P2265992875" "What can you do for me?"
// Answer Text :
"P1033615033" "Why should I trust you?"
// Page Option1A Text :
"P3713616691" "What can I do for you? What can I, {Hero.gender=male Dean MacArthur|The Daring D'ster} do for a {Hero.gender=male brosef|lovely rose} like you?<br><br>The answer is a lot. See, information, it just falls into my lap, like {Hero.gender=male rain falling on the meteors in Bloody Bay.|petals falling in a summer's garden.}<br><br>Now me, I think that information could be used against folks. You name 'em, Cage, Longbow, Wyvern, Legacy Chain, <i>PPD</i>, the works.<br><br>Buncha bums, you know? So I find this info, give it to you, and you do what you do with it!"
// Answer Text :
"P3254874543" "You're not looking to them for protection? From people like me?"
// Answer Text :
"P664619048" "Sounds a little too convenient, Dean."
// Page GoToD Text :
"P283672603" "Bwhu? Them protect me?<br><br>Look {Hero.gender=male man|babe}, I know how it goes around here. If these guys could protect anyone, they woulda gained control of the Isles.<br><br>But I know where the winning team is - {Hero.gender=male dudes|beautiful flowers} like you. And me? {Hero.gender=male I intend to be on the winning team, you know?| I intend to be on the winning team, you know? Especially with beautiful women like you on it!}"
// Answer Text :
"P2148950696" "I'll think it over and talk to you again soon."
// Page GoToE Text :
"P2213824789" "My life is all about being convenient! Like a fresh spring appearing in an arid desert...<br><br>Tell you the truth, okay? This is me, opening up to you, and I barely know you.<br><br>Those 'heroes' in Paragon, they got it all wrong. Someone's gotta shove 'em off their high horse. Enforcin' laws then lookin' the other way when them same laws destroy a person's life.<br><br>Now I know it ain't gonna be me. But I figure, helping someone like you will at least make a dent, yeah?"
// Answer Text :
"P3000762204" "So, you're some sort of freedom fighter?"
// Page GoToJ Text :
"P56352846" "You know what, I totally understand. A {Hero.gender=male guy|glowing beauty} like yourself has gotta be on the look out for scams.<br><br>Tell you what. I'll hang out here. When you're ready to get down to business, you let me know, and we can {Hero.gender=male get started|make some beautiful music together.}"
// Answer Text :
"P315916587" "Alright Dean, perhaps I'll be back."
// Page GoToK Text :
"P3206434380" "Freedom Fighter? {Hero.gender=male Nah, not at all, I'm just a man!|Sounds romantic...is that what you're interested in?} {Hero.gender=male A man who wants to upset the established order.|I'm fine with that title, or whatever else you wanna call me, eh?}<br><br>In the end, I know it's tough trusting folks here, yeah? But I tell you now, you work with me, I'll help you out with whatever needs doing. <br><br>Take your time, think it over, then you know what? {Hero.gender=male Dean|D-ster} here, I'll be waiting."
// Answer Text :
"P2781605395" "We'll see what happens Dean."
// Page GoToB Text :
"P4288390507" "{Hero.gender=male Trust? Huh...trust is a fickle mistress huh?|What, you don't trust the dashing, daring, dynamic D-Mac? Check out this flex, pow! How can you not trust that?}<br><br>But you're right, how can you trust me? Maybe I can say, 'You can trust me', but I know you're smarter than that.<br><br>You're talking to me, right? {Hero.gender=male Which means you're smarter already.|Which means you're smarter already. But still just as beautiful.}"
// Answer Text :
"P2539168479" "You still haven't answered my question."
// Answer Text :
"P1003353151" "Let's say I trust you - what then?"
// Page GoToF Text :
"P1126615340" "A smart one eh!<br><br>Well look, me, I'm not super-powered at all. Maybe I'm good with a gun, but that's it. So, you can trust me because you can trust that I don't want you <i>beating my face in</i> if I  {Hero.gender=male tried anything funny.|tried anything funny. Not that I wouldn't mind you getting your hands on me.}<br><br>Maybe some other folks here talk tough, but I know what I can do, and it for sure isn't close to what you can do."
// Answer Text :
"P2904060291" "I'll take your word, for now. What do you have for me?"
// Page GoToG Text :
"P1677419648" "What then? {Hero.gender=male We make a lot of things happen, that's what!|I've got way too many ideas for what we could do later. I'll save them for another day...}<br><br>But specifically, right now, we start moving on some things going down here in the Isles, yeah?<br><br>Now, I'm a guy who doesn't appreciate folks toutin' themselves over others, sayin' they're here to protect and all.<br><br>Which is why I found some dirt on this guy doing exactly that around these parts."
// Answer Text :
"P2851558353" "And who is this guy?"
// Page GoToL Text :
"P3192580697" "{Hero.gender=male I've got plenty up my sleeve, plenty!|Let's see...a few beautiful roses...some champagne...tickets for two to a play in St. Martial...}<br><br>But to get specific, I've got some tidbits on a pesky hero hanging around here. But tell you what, give me a second to get everything in order, yeah?<br><br>Just two seconds. And then you get your stuff in order.<br><br>When both of our...stuffs...are in order, we'll make things happen."
// Answer Text :
"P3534857243" "We'll see, Dean."
// Page GoToM Text :
"P1555811520" "He's...ah...uhm...<br><br>...okay. I'll be straight with you. I <i>know</i> who he is, but I honestly kind of thought you'd just walk away from me.<br><br>Give me a few minutes to do things all prepared-like, and then I will be MORE than happy to have this discussion with you."
// Answer Text :
"P3936123470" "Alright."
// Page GoToC Text :
"P2793435301" "{Hero.gender=male Yeah! See, that's what I'm all about, enthusiasm!|A woman who knows their worth, I like that.}<br><br>{Hero.gender=male Too many people in the Isles, they're all doom and gloom, you know?|Too many ladies around here are cold as ice, you look at them and you just freeze!} {Hero.gender=male But you and me man, I think we're gonna be good friends. Pals, maybe even amigos.|How about I go ahead and recite some poetry to you? I was thinking <i>just</i> about you when I wrote it.}"
// Answer Text :
"P2060235696" "{Hero.gender=male There aren't too many amigos around this place.|I'd love some poetry, but maybe later on.}"
// Answer Text :
"P2428936947" "{Hero.gender=male I wasn't being serious. Just get down to business.|I'm not interested in your poetry, just in your business.}"
// Page GoToH Text :
"P2626123724" "{Hero.gender=male Man, there are NO amigos in this place, I have searched high and low!| Alright, I'll wait 'till we're more acquainted. I shouldn't move so fast anyway, classic Dean mistake.}<br><br>So look, I'm gonna be honest, upfront about this with you.<br><br>I am seriously excited about us working together. It's gonna lead to something great! This must be how it was when Recluse first got started.<br><br>Or when that Nemesis guy began to play chess.<br><br>{Hero.gender=male Or when Black Scorpion got that power armor.|Or when Mako met Barracuda. ...I think? Are they together? That's what I was going for.}"
// Answer Text :
"P778275962" "{Hero.gender=male Maybe not like Black Scorpion. What's next?|I don't think they're together Dean. What's next?}"
// Page GoToI Text :
"P52515946" "...man, you sure know how to let someone down huh?<br><br>Guess you wouldn't have gotten outta Mercy Island if you weren't at least sort of ruthless.<br><br>Anyway...well...I guess, okay, look. I won't mope.<br><br>I won't!<br><br>Let's just, you know, move forward with this thing."
// Answer Text :
"P3916248446" "Good. Tell me everything you know."
// Page GoToN Text :
"P870743147" "What's next? Okay...good question.<br><br>I didn't really expect you to be on board with all of this so quickly. But then again, how often do you find {Hero.gender=male another amigo|a beautiful, non-ice queen lady} here?<br><br>Give me two seconds, really, just two seconds, to get my stuff together. Then we will make this HAPPEN!"
// Answer Text :
"P243087781" "Okay Dean."
// Page GoToO Text :
"P1395008693" "...erm. Okay. I can do that in two shakes of my {Hero.gender=male angry fist|broken hearted fist}. I kind of...well...didn't come prepared.<br><br>I've got the info on me! I just need to organize it so I'm not all over the place."
// Answer Text :
"P2009208813" "...hurry it up then Dean."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


