// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Henri Dumont 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4268824461" "Henri Dumont"
// ProfessionString :
"P1466983790" "Cage Consortium Executive"
// DescriptionString :
"P1588508733" "Henri Dumont is one of the top dogs for the Cage Consortium. It's his job to make sure the Sharkhead Isle operations run as smoothly as possible. He realizes that sometimes sacrifices must be made for profitability, and so is willing to sacrifice anything - or anyone - that gets in his way. He sometimes hires freelancers to deal with matters of special importance to the Cage Consortium."
// HelloString :
"P2779695930" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Bonjour, {VillainName}.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1032305375" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Ready to do some work, {VillainName}?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1447162990" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>'Allo.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3881869264" "I don't have any spare change. Please go away."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2263243916" "Ah, you must be {VillainName}! I am of course Henri Dumont, an executive of the Cage Consortium. I have been told you are a very capable individual, and the Cage Consortium has need of such individuals. I understand you may have had some run-ins with Cage Consortium employees in the past, but I'm willing to overlook these incidents if you are. Agreed?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P831776366" "You have completed your role as an asset to the Cage Consortium. Please move along."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P566499812" "You seem to have a full workload as is, {VillainName}. Come talk to me when you've settled some of your other matters."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1167645462" "I'm quite sorry mon ami, but you haven't fulfilled the minimum criteria for employment with the Cage Consortium at this tier. Come back when you've at least reached Threat Level {Level}."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P329833065" "Cage Consortium is beset by the scum of Sharkhead Isle, the rabble rousers who call themselves the Scrapyarders. If you can prove to me you're not with them, we can work together."
// BadgeFirstTick :
"P2428329743" "As near as I can tell, you're on the Scrapyarders' side. You've scarcely harmed a one of them."
// BadgeSecondTick :
"P1532008558" "You've taken out a few Scrapyarders, but I need more proof."
// BadgeFourthTick :
"P2524900982" "Take out just a few more Scrapyarders, and we'll be able to work together."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P257019681" "You do good work, mon ami! You must have my latest <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements!</a> Please, call!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1379545436" "You're got a bright future in the Cage Consortium, {VillainName}! Please, peruse my latest <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements!</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2690389251" "It looks like you've moved on to bigger and better things, {VillainName}. Au revoir!"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P4234850270" "Henri Dumont is a high-profile member of the Cage Consortium, and has some work for a freelancer who doesn't mind getting his or her hands dirty. Henri can get you Technology and Science Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3207946642" "Choose Henri Dumont"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2836884873" "He'll treat you like gold as long as you're useful to him, so enjoy the treatment while it lasts."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2420805507" "I know <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1123543269" "There's a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>couple of people</A> that may be of interest to you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


