// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Lt_Chalmers 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Lt. Chalmers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P5648503" "Lt. Chalmers"
// ProfessionString :
"P1376993441" "Sky Raider Lieutenant"
// DescriptionString :
"P3826639990" "Lieutenant Heathcliff Chalmers is a recent Sky Raider recruit, joining them from the ranks of the British SAS. It's rumored that he was originally part of a unit attempting to capture the leader of the Sky Raiders, Colonel Virgil Duray, but that once he learned more about the high-flying mercenaries, switched sides. Chalmers' organizational skill was soon recognized, and he's been tasked with organizing operations with freelance villains to achieve the Sky Raiders' goals."
// HelloString :
"P579700719" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hello!</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2931057501" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Greetings, {VillainName}!</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2036426811" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Excellent to see you, {VillainName}!</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2473635845" "You would be {VillainName}, right? Well, it is a pleasure to speak with you, but I'm afraid that I can only work with people who've had proper introductions. Must keep to the protocols, eh wot? Talk to Captain Petrovich, and then we'll speak."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3996288407" "Well, {VillainName}, as I believe you're aware, my name is Lieutenant Heathcliff Chalmers, Sky Raiders. The majority of my duties here on Sharkhead Isle are to work with freelancers such as yourself to best effect. It's quite a good piece of luck that you came by when you did, as I should have several things going on right now in need of due attention. Let me see..."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2483255967" "Well, hate to put a damper on things, {VillainName}, but that's about all I had. You've been a pleasure to work with, though, so just let me wish you the best of luck. Be seeing you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P975694408" "I hate to say this, {VillainName}, but you seem a bit busy right now. How about you get a few more things done, then pop right back by here and I'll see if I have some work we could use your talents on."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1529899601" "I'm terribly sorry, {VillainName}, but I'm afraid that all the tasks I have require someone with a higher Threat Level. About level {Level} would be right."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P742368694" "You've done a really smashing job, {VillainName}. Just tremendous! Please, peruse the new items in my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store.</a> You may ring me whenever you wish."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2024705840" "You work has been brilliant, {VillainName}! I'll see if I can get you authorized for more important tasks right away. I've already had you authorized for greater access to <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1230314854" "I'm terribly sorry, but I'm afraid that things have gone all quiet at the moment. Still, it's not like we're keeping you on retainer. Go on! Enjoy your freedom! Gallivant about and all that sort of thing."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2827460078" "Ya heard of Lieutenant Chalmers, I imagine? He be a member of the Sky Raiders, them high-flying mercenaries who been building up their power base lately. These Sky Raiders got themselves a base near Sharkhead, and Chalmers is in charge of hiring freelancers to help 'em out. He may be able to get you some work. Chalmers can get his hands on Magic and Mutant Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3802357175" "Choose Lt. Chalmers"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P252107980" "Chalmers may seem friendly, but remember that he joined the Sky Raiders by choice. Rumor has it he defected away from the British special forces when he did it. He's a dangerous person."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


