// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Mortimer_Kal 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Mortimer Kal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1396167818" "Mortimer Kal"
// LocationString :
// ProfessionString :
"P1624061746" "Midnighter Archmage"
// DescriptionString :
"P2617028515" "In the blackest arcane circles, the name Mortimer Kal is whispered with reverance and dread. One of the most potent archmages of our time, Mortimer Kal remained unknown to even the most knowledgable sorcerers until the late 1980s. After remaining nothing more than a whisper and myth for decades he suddenly emerged from seclusion and joined the Midnight Squad. The air of mystery continues to surround him as instead of revealing the secrets to life's grand design, or uncovering the key to unraveling ancient mysteries, he took on a simple instructor's mantle and has begun the mundane task of training the growing number of neophyte wizards in the Midnight Squad. There are many theories as to why Mortimer Kal suddenly stepped out of the shadows, and more still about his choice to become a simple instructor. Some theorize that his powers are waning, while others believe his time in this world has amounted to nothing, and his time is soon to an end."
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P730807637" "The stars have not yet aligned. We will talk when they have."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P4164804302" "Perhaps this is what The Fates had ordained for me on that day my Fiona was born, that I should rise to the heavens beyond her reach, and then descend into darkness to save her. If that is my lot then so be it, I am at your service until The Fates decides otherwise.<br><br>I have glimpsed where you must go in order to claim the Flames of Prometheus. Do you dare journey into the ensorcelled realm of Oranbega, the subterranean city of the Circle of Thorns? For that is where you must go in order to take the first step onto the path to absolute power.<br><br>If I were you, I would not go alone."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P3460798972" "I applaud your cruel ambition, but your powers are not sufficient for the dark realms where I travel. Return when you have achieved at least a threat level of 20. Then, you may be strong enough to survive. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Strike Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P267799575" "Your power exceeds my capabilities. Please, go, and find other things to occupy your wicked mind. "
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P1730045544" "You will need at least 4 fiends, madmen, and lawless rogues for this. Return when you have assembled your cadre of deviants. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Strike Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P1356542701" "Send your leader to me. I would speak with them about things dark and vile. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Strike Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P2925953681" "I do not see the number of rogues you claim to have. Bring all of your group to the island. Then we can begin. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Strike Force.</color>"
// BadTeamLevel :
"P3311708628" "I fear that some within your group are not within the range of power you need. I'll leave it to you to fix. Return when you are between a threat level of 20 and 40. Then, I can be of use to you. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 4 members on your team, all of them at least Level 20. If they are over Level 40, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 40 for the duration of the Strike Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P810230719" "Strike Force Torch"
// TaskForceName :
"P3147526561" "Strike Force Spark"
// TaskForceName :
"P4131930327" "Strike Force Radiance"
// TaskForceName :
"P2612361033" "Strike Force Kindle"
// TaskForceName :
"P3560028104" "Strike Force Firebrand"
// TaskForceName :
"P1327324420" "Strike Force Brilliance"
// HelloString :
"P3792553768" "How fares my daughter?"
// HelloString :
"P4075897367" "When can I see my daughter, {HeroName}?"
// HelloString :
"P184453263" "As I said, this path will not be an easy one."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1886123713" "Leave this old wizard to his thoughts."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3655096136" "Leave me to my thoughts and the sea. Both are troubled and need calming."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1394403513" "Until my daughter is returned... I am yours to command. But mark my words, {HeroName}. Flame of Prometheus or not, if any harm comes to Fiona, your existence is forfeit."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P10875735" "This task requires your full attention. If you will not focus then I cannot help you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P65372146" "The things I have seen would crush your will like a grape. Speak to me when you have grown more powerful."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P291947265" "Something in the cosmos is very wrong, the Makers must know."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


