// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Operative_Vargas 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Operative Vargas 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3683996103" "Operative Vargas"
// ProfessionString :
"P871174980" "Arachnos Operative"
// DescriptionString :
"P237627512" "Operative Leonard Vargas is one of the brightest rising stars in Arachnos. He joined the organization after completing his Bachelor's degree in business at an Ivy league school, and has since begun a rapid rise through the ranks. While he's lacking in combat experience, his initiative, efficiency, and ability to get things done have attracted a lot of attention, particularly among the Arbiter Corps."
// HelloString :
"P347231357" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Are you ready to leverage your abilities to their fullest, {VillainName}?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2912120946" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I am here, ready and waiting, to help you maximize your potential!</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3886683722" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>It's always a pleasure to talk to a fellow professional.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P938651975" "Yeah, look, I don't mean to be rude, and I want you to understand that I have the utmost respect for you, {VillainName}, but I'm not certain that a working relationship would optimize either of our potentialities at this time. Perhaps Lorenz Ansaldo could change my mind about that. Why don't you talk to him?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P4204800171" "{VillainName}! It is so good to finally get this chance to get to know you. I'm Operative Leonard Vargas, but please, just call me Leo. I want to promote a mutual zone of facilitation between us, so we don't have to stand on titles. You're here because you want to improve your prospects and increase the potential for your continued advancement. And I am all about continued advancement. So let's get started, huh?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2936659340" "At every point, in every working relationship, no: in every partnership; and I do think of our work together as a partnership from which we both benefited, don't get me wrong; there's a point when both factions have to realize that everyone's best interests are served by dissolving that association. And {VillainName}: We've reached that point. I know you've been thinking the same thing, so I'll be the bad guy here and be the one to say it. Now, it's not like I'm firing you. We were partners. If anything, I'm firing me. But that's just the realities of business. It's been great working with you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P826138845" "I've taken a look at your schedule, and it looks to me like you're over-booked. Now, I like to see that. I like to see initiative. I like to see an empowered individual like yourself trying to realize their full potential. But at the same time, I need to make sure that you can devote your full attention to what I have for you. You finish up with the rest, and I will be ready with projects for you."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P593094411" "I have something, and don't get me wrong, I want you on it more than anyone else. But I'm going to need you to realize a bit more of your potential before I give it to you. I have to make sure that you can fully utilize this opportunity, or else I'm not doing a favor to either of us."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1782454635" "Working with you has been, wow, what can I say? Enlightening. There. I said it. If you'll take a look-see at my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store,</a> I think I can help you actualize your potential. We must speak more often."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3838619480" "You have been working so far ahead of projections that I am considering outsourcing all future contracts to you. And I don't say that kind of thing lightly. If you need any help achieving your dreams, I would be happy to provide you with <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1290132262" "I really hate to have to say this to you, {VillainName}, but I'm afraid that you're, well, overqualified for the opportunities I have at present."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P57020413" "I guess you heard of Operative Leonard Vargas, huh, kid? he's one of the rising stars of Arachnos. He joined up right after graduating an Ivy-league school with a business degree, and he talks like it. He's one to watch, and he's looking for freelancers at the moment. He usually has an overwhelming supply of Mutant and Science Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2732132748" "Choose Operative Vargas"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P740123504" "Leo is one of the smartest young guys in Arachnos. Knowing him now may be a very good thing for you down the line."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


