// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Sir_Leonard 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Leonard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2561024276" "Leonard"
// LocationString :
// ProfessionString :
"P2775496425" "Bodyguard"
// DescriptionString :
"P4135881950" "Leonard Silmon was the bodyguard for Thomas Mane, the president of Mane Corporation.<br><br>It's odd however, for him not to be seen around Thomas Mane, the man he is supposed to be guarding."
// HelloString :
"P342447633" "Hello to you, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P3674539434" "Shall we?"
// HelloString :
"P1379204922" "Let us continue this."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1003551868" "Unfortunately, you and I are not on a working relationship yet. I have heard of you, {HeroName}, and I respect you. Please do not take this the wrong way.<br><br>I am sure that in the future, you and I could be of some use to each other."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P986730333" "I don't have anything more for you, perhaps your other contacts have something?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3048106399" "It's never good to overwork yourself, {HeroName}. Please take care of what you're doing now, and we shall continue on our business."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2552546582" "The company I work for deals in very...dangerous things. You'd do best to come back when you've acquainted yourself more with said dangerous things."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P2539071072" "I'm terribly sorry, but I don't believe you and I have any common business to discuss."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1805468761" "The business I handle is too small compared to what you've been up to lately, {HeroName}. I would not try to waste your time with it."
// IntroString :
"P2550475710" "So that Leonard guy, I gave him a ring. He said he's waiting to talk to you now in Sharkhead, something about a real big deal.<br><br>I'd check it out, especially if he can get that whole cloning thing up and running, yeah? Just don't forget old D-Mac when the time comes!"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3418780295" "Meet with Sir Leonard"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1587034678" "You ain't gonna regret this, trust me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P2791140012" "Hello {HeroName}. I believe our mutual friend, Dean MacArthur, has told you that I am interested in aiding your efforts with your clone facility, correct?<br><br>My name is <color yellow>Leonard</color>. Just Leonard, I'm not fond about giving out my last name.<br><br> I'm speaking with you today on behalf of <color yellow>Mane Corp</color>.<br><br>We are willing to put all of our resources towards helping you get your cloning facility up, running, and, most importantly, properly defended."
// Answer Text :
"P291253997" "I've never heard of Mane Corp. How could you help me?"
// Answer Text :
"P1671281703" "What reason do I have to trust you?"
// Page Option1A Text :
"P3939218174" "Yes, Mane Corp isn't as big as we would like. It's difficult when you're competing with Crey Industries and Aeon Corp.<br><br>However, we firmly believe that we have the resources to support your research into this facility. If not, then you can feel free to remove us at any time."
// Answer Text :
"P944118639" "Let's say I let you help me. What're you going to do?"
// Page GoToD Text :
"P554074098" "We have enough money saved up that we can afford to supply the base with the proper defensive infrastructure. <br><br>The Isles are a dangerous place, as you're aware of. We will get the best guards that money can buy to ensure that no one else within Sharkhead even <i>thinks</i> about assaulting your facility.<br><br>We will also hire a team of scientists to work underneath the ones you currently have.<br><br>Lastly, we shall increase the power supply for your base, allowing full production of the clones - once the process is complete."
// Answer Text :
"P307428503" "And what do you want from me?"
// Page GoToE Text :
"P23763782" "You're now in section E of the choices"
// Answer Text :
"P2550322179" "Move forward"
// Page GoToJ Text :
"P431713783" "All we need from you is your support, {HeroName}.<br><br>You've already done most of the work of getting the clone facility. I will not lie to you - Mane Corp hopes that our research in this will help propel us onto the level of Aeon Corp and Crey.<br><br>All we ask from you is that when the time comes, you do not betray us and use your clone army to wipe Mane Corp from the map. I think that's a fair enough deal, yes? <br><br><color orange>Leonard's deal is very lucrative - given that your facility is under-funded, under-protected, and barely working. You can work together with Mane Corp, for now. But when push comes to shove, who is going to stop you and an army of your clones?"
// Answer Text :
"P1713902472" "Alright Leonard, we have a deal. Send your team in."
// Page GoToK Text :
"P1385121872" "You're now in K, this is the end of the A path."
// Answer Text :
"P2559484788" "Finish"
// Page GoToB Text :
"P2756580316" "I know, {HeroName}, that you're used to people using you, double-crossing you.<br><br>I shall be upfront about this. We do intend to use this for our own gain. Mane Corp has been hurting for quite some time to make a name for ourselves, to be elevated to the level of Crey or Aeon Corp.<br><br>However, I can promise you that we have no intention of back-stabbing you.<br><br>We will use the research done here to show that Mane Corp has the skill to get things done. And perhaps, if you'd allow us, to say that we're allied with you, the {Hero.gender=male man|woman} with a clone army at their disposal."
// Answer Text :
"P2698409353" "What exactly can Mane Corp do for me?"
// Answer Text :
"P1540577749" "Sounds promising. When can you start?"
// Page GoToG Text :
"P2677896884" "You're now in section G of the B path."
// Page GoToL Text :
"P3740668947" "Right away. I'll send our team in now to help get your base set up, along with our guards.<br><br>We can begin to move in the proper militaristic provisions to get the base well guarded. It shouldn't take too long."
// Answer Text :
"P1026150484" "Excellent, make it happen."
// Page GoToM Text :
"P2596864682" "You're now in the M path of section G, this is the end of section B."
// Page GoToC Text :
"P4204562172" "You're now in the C path."
// Answer Text :
"P3878442963" "Choice 1"
// Answer Text :
"P3422618640" "Choice 2"
// Page GoToH Text :
"P2269470923" "You're now in the H path of C."
// Page GoToI Text :
"P2081367773" "You're now in the I path of O"
// Answer Text :
"P1635038805" "Move Forward"
// Page GoToN Text :
"P424676982" "You're on the N path of section C, this is the end of section C."
// Page GoToO Text :
"P3895794406" "You're now on the O path of section C, this is the end of setion C"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


