// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Vince_Dubrowski 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Vince Dubrowski 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2825644843" "Vince Dubrowski"
// ProfessionString :
"P3886165785" "Cage Consortium Representative"
// DescriptionString :
"P2685051985" "If there's one thing Cage Consortium believes in, it's profit. That's why Vince Dubrowski's here. Vince is in charge of keeping down the rabble-rousing Scrapyarders who are throwing a wrench into the well-oiled machine of the Consortium's bauxite mining. Vince never questions his orders to bust up Scrapyarder safehouses, put down picket lines with militant force, or even have a few of the more troublesome louts arrested on false charges. Because if there's one thing Vince Dubrowski believes in, it's loyalty. He gave his soul to the Consortium long ago, and he's never looked back."
// HelloString :
"P2224119966" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hey, buddy. Ready to rumble?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1200811183" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We got troubles, you know?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2753931552" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>The Consortium needs our help.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P573750202" "You don't work for the Consortium, and that means you got no business with me. You want that to change? Try talking to some brokers; they're on your map."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2126834333" "Hey, there, {VillainName}. Let's get one thing straight from the start: I work for the Consortium. Naw, that ain't the right way to put it. I live for the Consortium. Help us out, and we can both make a profit. Turn against us, and you will have no greater enemy than Vince Dubrowski. Got it?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P820304050" "I got nothing for you. Ask someone else."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P80388488" "You're busy, {VillainName}, and the Consortium deserves your full attention. Clear out some of your old jobs and we'll talk."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1753895599" "I got something, but you got to earn this one. Say by getting to Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4248706314" "Friend, I'm pleased the Consortium has us working together. We're a good team, yeah? You call me whenever you like. And check out the new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> in my store."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4287736403" "I think I can trust you with some of the Consortium's deeper secrets. Just don't rat them out, or you'll have me to deal with. If you'll take a look at my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store,</a> I think I can help you further."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1776934237" "We got no more to do with each other, {VillainName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2577007567" "Have you met Vince Dubrowski? He's working for the Cage Consortium, trying to keep their Sharkhead Isle mining operation in the black. That brings him into contact with the Scrapyarders quite a bit.  His connections at Cage can get him Natural and Technology Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3253855010" "Choose Vince Dubrowski"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1262866446" "When it comes to dedication, Vince takes the cake. Don't say a word against Cage Consortium where he can hear."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4276442554" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Someone</a> I know wants to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P958727691" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>I got some people who'd like to meet you.</a>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


