// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Vincent_Ross 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Vincent Ross 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3568017583" "Vincent Ross"
// LocationString :
// ProfessionString :
"P4187287119" "Former Legacy Chain Researcher"
// DescriptionString :
"P2401353405" "Vincent Ross was once a member of the Legacy Chain, something which is obvious by the outfit that he still wears. It's widely known to the inhabitants of Sharkhead that he and the group had a falling out of sorts, though what exactly happened is not known to many."
// HelloString :
"P3564294575" "Let us continue our tale of vengeance."
// HelloString :
"P3790998753" "The time is nearing to make our enemies cower in fear, {HeroName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P551166190" "We have no reason to talk to each other. So let's not begin to."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P65366309" "There is nothing left for us to do together, {HeroName}. Let us not dwell further on the matter."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P16620275" "We have much to do, {HeroName}, I need your full attention if we're going to accomplish our goals."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Praetorian Text :
"P1193892290" "Hello. {HeroName}. I have heard about you from Viridian, a man who I would have once considered an enemy. You may or may not know me, so I shall introduce myself. I am Vincent Ross, a former member of the <color yellow>Legacy Chain.</color> The Legacy Chain is a group of <i>ignorant</i> magic users who try to police Paragon and the Isles with their <i>rules</i>. They believe they are righteous, that they are all-knowing. They are wrong on both accounts.<br><br>I'm speaking with you today because I believe that you and I can help each other."
// Answer Text :
"P2817404675" "What do you mean?"
// Answer Text :
"P167361481" "(Check to make sure that this isn't Protean in disguise)"
// Page Protean Text :
"P4132510643" "<color orange>You do what you can to see if Vincent Ross is actually Protean. Ross looks somewhat uncomfortable as you look him over, but eventually you come to the conclusion that Ross is not Protean.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3637115374" "Anyway. Continue with what you were saying."
// Page ImPraetorian Text :
"P552009596" "I was heavily involved with operations that the Legacy Chain had here in the Isles. Operations involving a substance known as <color yellow>red coral.</color> This substance, {HeroName}, is quite powerful, rumored to be part of an ancient, slumbering beast called <color yellow>the Leviathan.</color> This red coral is very precious within Sharkhead Isle, enough that Cage Consortium has created an entire industry around it. This small piece of rock can do wonderous things... it can increase one's power, even animate <i>static</i> objects.<br><br>However, what the Legacy Chain discovered is that there is something... <i>better</i> than this red coral. Something that could give a group true power to do whatever they wished. The Legacy Chain seeks to use that power for their own goals of bringing 'justice' to Sharkhead Isle. They are all <i>fools</i>, and I would seek their destruction. I imagine that one such as yourself would be against this, and so it is here that I wish to make a deal with you. Aid me in destroying the Legacy Chain in Sharkhead, and I shall help you obtain the Legacy Chain's secret project: <color yellow>Blood Coral.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1624719919" "What is this Blood Coral?"
// Page PraetorianWhereProblem Text :
"P1209211826" "Blood Coral is much stronger than Red Coral. If you gather enough of it, you will have a <color yellow>direct link to the Leviathan itself.</color> <i>My</i> research indicated that if a person gathered enough of the red coral, they could physically go inside the Leviathan and gain control of it. That, {HeroName}, is what the Legacy Chain are after. They seek to utilize the Leviathan for their own ends, to use it as a weapon against Arachnos and to bring in any super-powered being in the Isles who they believe are against them.<br><br>You can see now, the gravity of the situation. I, myself, care little for the power of the Leviathan. In fact, given... various events that happened, it would be <i>very bad</i> for me to get anywhere near the creature. All I care about is utterly destroying those scum in the Legacy Chain, and I believe helping you obtain this Red Coral would do that.<br><br>Shall we begin working together?"
// Answer Text :
"P247954360" "Let's begin. We need a plan of attack."
// Answer Text :
"P1602096488" "Hold on a minute. How can I trust you?"
// Page HidePraetorian Text :
"P358314289" "Trust me? I suppose trust is a difficult thing, isn't it? I trusted the Legacy Chain once, only for them to <i>backstab</i> me when my research went poorly.<br><br>Suffice to say, {HeroName}, I was investigating things that the Legacy Chain... frowned upon. When they discovered what my research, the same research that was supposed to <i>help</i> the group with Blood Coral, was doing to me, they tried to have me arrested. But I was able to escape, {HeroName}. Day by day, my mind becomes clearer as to what the true nature of my former 'friends' were; nothing but traitors, backstabbers, and glory-hounds.<br><br>No, {HeroName}, you do not have to worry about trust from me. I have felt the bitter sting of betrayal. I will not do that to you, I swear."
// Answer Text :
"P3166521452" "Alright, let's get moving. We need a plan of attack."
// Page NotPraetorian Text :
"P3863591059" "Hello. {HeroName}. I've heard a lot about your exploits here within the Isles, both from the side of the 'law' and the other side. Allow me to introduce myself, properly. My name is Vincent Ross, former Legacy Chain researcher. I'm sure you've run into the group during your travels. If not, then that's too bad, because each of them deserves to be tortured and killed for their actions.<br><br>Ahem... as you can see, I have a rather strong opinion about the group. At any rate, I believe that given my background and your talents, you and I have the opportunity to help each other get what we want."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

